## 🚀 Project Overview

Developed an interactive **Power BI Sales Analytics Dashboard** for Blinkit to monitor sales performance, customer preferences, outlet efficiency, and product trends.

The dashboard enables stakeholders to identify revenue drivers, evaluate outlet performance, and make data-driven business decisions through dynamic visualizations and KPI tracking.

---

## 🎯 Business Objectives

* Analyze overall sales performance across outlets
* Identify top-performing outlet types and locations
* Evaluate product category contribution to revenue
* Understand customer buying behavior
* Support strategic business expansion decisions

---

## 📈 Key Performance Indicators

| Metric              | Value  |
| ------------------- | ------ |
| 💰 Total Sales      | ₹1.20M |
| 📦 Total Items Sold | 9K     |
| 📊 Average Sales    | ₹141   |
| ⭐ Average Rating    | 4.0    |

---

## 📊 Dashboard Highlights

### Sales Performance Analysis

* Revenue tracking across all outlets
* KPI monitoring and trend analysis
* Outlet establishment performance evaluation

### Product Analysis

* Fat Content Analysis
* Item Category Performance
* Product Contribution Analysis

### Outlet Analysis

* Outlet Size Performance
* Outlet Location Comparison
* Outlet Type Analysis

### Customer Insights

* Product Preferences
* Average Ratings
* Purchase Behavior Trends

---

## 🔍 Key Business Insights

### Revenue Insights

* Generated over **₹1.2 Million** in total sales.
* **Supermarket Type 1** contributed the highest revenue.
* **Tier 3 outlets** outperformed Tier 1 and Tier 2 locations.

### Product Insights

* Regular-fat products generated the majority of sales.
* Household, Dairy, and Snack Foods emerged as top-performing categories.

### Operational Insights

* Medium-sized outlets delivered the highest sales contribution.
* Customer ratings remained consistently high at **4.0/5**.

